ίλων Ξενοπούλειου Βιβλιοθήκης σε συνεργασία με τον Σύλλο","image":"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5p9bwwd-YAl-nfn24hgxRYaAiD568P7uantRdSVowF4p602Xy_RIBNYNDsPcV0x16k1-qg0sMNisK3gJMFfPVV_LTjNutPcSNcmyAUC60G1PA97ubYj7cLYad46fjFtbyFJXfcAvvimev91cj2Mo7rGOOqji8gCNARyaACeql-iSo-iYm9JVrHFCXPd4/s320/%CE%9A%CE%91%CE%A1%CE%A5%CE%A3%CE%A4%CE%99%CE%91%CE%9D%CE%9F%CE%A5.jpg","audience":"children","originalUrl":"https://filoixenopouliou.blogspot.com/2025/05/1-6-2025.html"},{"id":"7833555023931049610","title":"«Μύθοι Λουλουδιών» 16-5-2025","date":"2025-05-19","eventDate":"2025-05-16","content":"<p><span><span> <span><span>Την\n Παρασκευή 16/5, είχαμε τη χαρά να πραγματοποιήσουμε μια ξεχωριστή \nεκπαιδευτική δράση με αφορμή το υπέροχο βιβλίο «Οι Μύθοι των Λουλουδιών \n» με την εκπαιδευτικό Λένα Παπανδρέου.</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span> </span></span></span></span></p><div><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7s-AnUpobRbJWVUZozauMicJP9TnyjX58Inu2QY10SPg39BFEPFpU24bmwr7nWskH7Uw14CvR2TBX6JyYpYNxt-mgaMZLCu9wnP9HnwKKxYz7NArrXWRirWD4LaimDwsTY_Q9qVyAcNU0dGk1XV2rkG4ctZ86Di-EsLF7uXK89jKy3OlcJQeKtnkW6_U/s1600/3%CE%91.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7s-AnUpobRbJWVUZozauMicJP9TnyjX58Inu2QY10SPg39BFEPFpU24bmwr7nWskH7Uw14CvR2TBX6JyYpYNxt-mgaMZLCu9wnP9HnwKKxYz7NArrXWRirWD4LaimDwsTY_Q9qVyAcNU0dGk1XV2rkG4ctZ86Di-EsLF7uXK89jKy3OlcJQeKtnkW6_U/s320/3%CE%91.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"148\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></span></div><span><br /><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwyASTOyoCpuUOtWBV4TUljFvbvd6ByQuA0ndevp5Y5lFbeT75lcbFzcgt0oXqyhQwevArTJgBgQGL_uIT1xiyTbqMYrymEE4AP-CTsogZGO24OPKTnUSqqZmftTcH-afdJBfkhUreYC7vL9Gu8Z7Z50mX_36Y0FlwFyD3aaL5XLVawVgRZICiBSN39NI/s1600/1%CE%91.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwyASTOyoCpuUOtWBV4TUljFvbvd6ByQuA0ndevp5Y5lFbeT75lcbFzcgt0oXqyhQwevArTJgBgQGL_uIT1xiyTbqMYrymEE4AP-CTsogZGO24OPKTnUSqqZmftTcH-afdJBfkhUreYC7vL9Gu8Z7Z50mX_36Y0FlwFyD3aaL5XLVawVgRZICiBSN39NI/s320/1%CE%91.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"148\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></div><br /></span><p></p><p><span><span><span><span> Μέσα από την αφήγηση, τα παιδιά ταξίδεψαν στον κόσμο της αυτογνωσίας,\n της αποδοχής και της ελευθερίας. Στη συνέχεια, εμπνευσμένα από τον \n«Μύθο Τριαντάφυλλου», δημιούργησαν τα δικά τους πολύχρωμα μπουκέτα με \nτριαντάφυλλα, γεμάτα φαντασία, ευαισθησία και αγάπη. </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhgYBmhZHIZgqhYSrvlhdsPpGiRSaxtU5M_LihK2Ilm7obn-4VH-SCf_20msgxwhR87FkDLV3lL0BcjSKnntDi71TmGJOQeFzVG8syst73mk2SJz0YC6f5PYnfV7qpN0Ay8dTE01iq9kEB6pU_1Df_8iwAHqeGFjToJDRcvf_hqK_1xF7sz7D8HoEZegJg/s1599/2%CE%91.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhgYBmhZHIZgqhYSrvlhdsPpGiRSaxtU5M_LihK2Ilm7obn-4VH-SCf_20msgxwhR87FkDLV3lL0BcjSKnntDi71TmGJOQeFzVG8syst73mk2SJz0YC6f5PYnfV7qpN0Ay8dTE01iq9kEB6pU_1Df_8iwAHqeGFjToJDRcvf_hqK_1xF7sz7D8HoEZegJg/s320/2%CE%91.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"148\" height=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></span></div><span><br /><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgqD6JGqcAv2la2BHHalccfV-D3xkx9qcjKrCI1hergno1kZsY0QLu_y4r3Prx5xur_lWnFET5da-EFnTXdVlbtK4ZqZJbhDWLOfpOm5je3wdTwLn43IRLsfgrJwkZgRSNdJYGs5s_J-XdtcG3UIHOabaaSJ7Ve7umJYvAGWi8YjDlupYehvcum8tdTGDs/s1600/4%CE%91.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgqD6JGqcAv2la2BHHalccfV-D3xkx9qcjKrCI1hergno1kZsY0QLu_y4r3Prx5xur_lWnFET5da-EFnTXdVlbtK4ZqZJbhDWLOfpOm5je3wdTwLn43IRLsfgrJwkZgRSNdJYGs5s_J-